<p class="lead">Everything a temporary inbox should be. Free, fast and private, with nothing to sign up for.</p>
<div class="feature-grid">
  <div class="fcard"><span class="ficon ficon-violet">&#9889;</span><h3>Instant address, no sign-up</h3><p>A fresh address is ready the moment the page opens. Copy it with one tap, or make a new one any time.</p></div>
  <div class="fcard"><span class="ficon ficon-blue">&#128229;</span><h3>Real-time inbox</h3><p>Email appears within seconds without reloading. Turn Auto Refresh off if you only want to check by hand.</p></div>
  <div class="fcard"><span class="ficon ficon-green">&#128273;</span><h3>One-tap verification codes</h3><p>We spot the code in the email and show a copy button, so you never have to hunt for it.</p></div>
  <div class="fcard"><span class="ficon ficon-red">&#128274;</span><h3>Private by design</h3><p>No personal details needed. Email HTML runs in a sandbox with scripts blocked, and mail is deleted when the address expires.</p></div>
